<title>FRANCE: Rexel H1 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Rexel H1 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					13,684    vs   11,595</p>
<p>     - includes Q2				 7,177    vs    5,919</p>
<p>NOTE - Rexel, controlled by retail group Pinault-Printemps-Redoute, reported its half-year sales in the official bulletin BALO. It said they were up 0.1 percent at comparable structure and exchange rates.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
